@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title UC-42 - View Stock by Product

actor "Admin" as Actor
boundary "Admin Inventory UI" as FE
control "InventoryController" as API
control "InventoryService" as Service
database "MongoDB: shoesDetail, stockMovements" as DB

Actor -> FE: Start UC-42
FE -> API: GET /inventory/overview
API -> Service: Execute View Stock by Product
Service -> DB: Read/write shoesDetail, stockMovements
DB --> Service: Domain data
Service --> API: Result
API --> FE: Response
FE --> Actor: Hiển thị chi tiết stock theo color + size

note over Actor,DB
Pre: Đã chọn 1 sản phẩm
Post: Hiển thị chi tiết stock theo color + size
Main flow:
1. Admin click vào sản phẩm
2. System gọi API GET /inventory/:productId
3. System trả về colors[] với sizes[] và stock cho mỗi size
4. Hiển thị bảng chi tiết
end note
@enduml
